{"article": {"content": {"content": "<div data-contents-type=\"text\"><div class=\"fr-image\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-contents-json=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fc33c726-17e5a38a-fe5c-4f9e-b9a1-f849da447b66&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null}\" data-contents-type=\"image\"><div class=\"fe-image-inner\"><img src=\"https://fizz-download.playnccdn.com/lg/file/AION/download/1a0fc33c726-17e5a38a-fe5c-4f9e-b9a1-f849da447b66\" alt=\"announcements_EN.jpg\" class=\"fe-image\"></div></div></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">Prepare yourselves Daevas! The first Elyos and Asmodian server pairings have been revealed. Find your server below to see which server will become your first enemy in Atreia.&nbsp;</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><h2 id=\"\">What is Server Matchmaking?</h2><div data-contents-type=\"text\">In Aion 2, the Elyos and Asmodians each live on their own servers. But the war between the factions doesn't stay behind borders for long. As you journey through Atreia, you'll get chances to face the opposing faction in modes such as <strong>Spacetime Rifts</strong> and <strong>the Abyss</strong>.&nbsp;</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">To bring the two sides together, each Elyos server is paired with an Asmodian server for a limited time. Whenever you enter the Abyss or another cross-faction mode, the players you meet from the other faction will come from your matched server.&nbsp;</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">&nbsp;</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\">For example, if the Asmodian server <strong>Israphel</strong> is paired with the Elyos server <strong>Siel</strong>, every Israphel Asmodian who enters the Abyss will run into Siel's Elyos. Those are the players you'll be clashing with, competing against, and\u2026 holding grudges against.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div data-contents-type=\"text\"><br class=\"ProseMirror-trailingBreak\"></div><h2 id=\"\">Global Server Pairings&nbsp;</h2><h3 id=\"\">Europe</h3><div class=\"tableWrapper\"><table class=\"_2CAsiFd9UHbUOqzd0e7ioe _1CtoyG6UPAlYp7PCGLXx8L\" style=\"width: 45.5511%;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 230px;\"><col style=\"width: 231px;\"><col style=\"width: 225px;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr><th data-colwidth=\"230\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Pair #</strong>&nbsp;</div></th><th data-colwidth=\"231\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Elyos Server</strong>&nbsp;</div></th><th data-colwidth=\"225\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Asmodian Server</strong>&nbsp;</div></th></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"230\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa selectedCell\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">1</div></td><td data-colwidth=\"231\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa selectedCell\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Siel</div></td><td data-colwidth=\"225\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa selectedCell\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Israphel</div></td></tr><tr><td data-colwidth=\"230\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa selectedCell\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">2</div></td><td data-colwidth=\"231\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa selectedCell\"><div data-contents-type=\"text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Nezekan</div></td><td data-colwidth=\"225\" style=\"padding: 4px 8px;\" class=\"_3rLIt0O8F7iG6B2RmC3cYa selectedCell\">